<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13320" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπονοσφίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put asunder, exclude from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ δόμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Cer.</u>
					158
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bereave</i> or <i>rob of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλων τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					979
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be robbed of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδωδήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					562
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>embezzle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κοινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					515.49
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Mylasa</span>), prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				37
			</span></i> (Teos, <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc. loci, <i>flee from, shun,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				480
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				131
			</span></i>.</div>
